	;  PVA342  (12/15/2015) - Generate ojfilters for sharding only when really needed, and fix interaction between aggregates and outer joins (for sharding) 
	;  PVA323  (06/02/2015) - Fix OR->UNION optimization in case when scalar subquery from merged view is shared between SELECT and one of the OR terms     ;  PVA316  (02/04/2015) - Make cost based decision for or->union optimization for multi-table OR condition case 
	;  PVA304  (04/23/2014) - Support %PARTITION BY for use by parallel work units 
	;  PVA300  (01/23/2014) - Fix: left join to view that selects expression that maps null to not null may produce wrong answer 
	;  PVA299  (01/22/2014) - fix: possible wrong answer for LEFT JOIN from an [in line] view that SELECTs expressions 
	;  PVA291  (09/30/2013) - Fix some (rare) wrong answers introduced by PVA289 
	;  PVA289  (09/26/2013) - Fix: Bad plan after Or to UNION optimization 
	;  PVA252  (02/24/2012) - Fix error (<UNDEFINED>indexed2+1^%qaqpre3) for certain rare queries with OR to UNION optimizaiton 
	;  AK831   (10/04/2011) - Correct more NOT EXISTS SVSO logic
	;  AK822   (08/22/2011) - Improve recursive lvarg calls
	;  PVA242  (07/28/2011) - Support a hint (%noindex) to not use indexes to satisfy the indicated condition
	;  PVA239  (03/29/2011) - Fix <UNDEFINED>mergeEquivAggs+36^%qaqpre2
	;  PVA233  (12/06/2010) - Fix FULL OUTER JOIN <undefined> errors introduced by PVA231
	;  PVA231  (11/30/2010) - Implement view.%id feature
	;  PVA224  (05/11/2010) - Restore functioning of AK526
	;  JLF339  (01/15/2010) - Support cloning of collection references
	;  PVA208  (11/10/2009) - Implement keyword to specify table to start joins from: %STARTTABLE
	;  JLF323  (11/18/2009) - Restrict redirectRef to transform only val ("v") node arguments
	;  BJB426  (10/22/2009) - Make sure %READERLIST is added to mt and mts array in pre parser
	;  PVA200  (10/14/2009) - Fix "<UNDEFINED>indexed2+1^%qaqpre3 *mts(" for certain queries
	;  PVA198  (09/04/2009) - Extend AK743 to cover remaining opportunities for view output optimization
	;  JLF275  (09/04/2009) - Create special lexer functions for double quoted XML tag names
	;  JLF266  (08/18/2009) - Perform join analysis in DISTINCT optimization
	;  JLF263  (08/05/2009) - Consider ORDER BY when merging equivalent aggregates
	;  PVA183  (05/26/2009) - Pre-optimizer support for TOP...ORDER BY in subqueries
	;  PVA179  (05/18/2009) - Fix execution time <undefined> for a query with multiple opportunities for OR to UNION optimization
	;  PVA175  (03/20/2009) - Fix: A query with a complex OR condition involving a unary function, that also refers to the same unary function elsewhere, may fail
	;  PVA174  (03/19/2009) - Fix side effects of PVA173: fix references in deep query streams only for view merging
	;  PVA170  (03/03/2009) - Fix: <UNDEFINED>setqparms+4^%qaqpre2 *mt("w",<number>)
	;  AK721   (02/03/2009) - Preserve linked subqueries
	;  PVA165 - Fix problem with OR to UNION optimization: <UNDEFINED>corr+2^%qaqpnl *$$$mtP(0)
	;  DPV3337 (01/09/2008) - New movenames, not movnames in cr8strview; new fcols in cr8query
	;  DPV3258 (12/10/2008) - Avoid <SUBSCRIPT> error if $p(v,"^",2,3) is long because of -> joins
	;  PVA162  (10/29/2008) - Fix <UNDEFINED>getidval+1^%qaqpre2 error from a left join
	;  DPV3238 (08/06/2008) - Correct type reported for %SIMILARITY function 
	;  DPV3231 (08/05/2008) - Use process private global for ptln, ptrel
	;  PVA159  (07/29/2008) - Clean up orphaned subqueries
	;  PVA158  (07/20/2008) - Utility for OR to UNION transformation
