	;  JLF214  (04/08/2008) - Support text operators on streamed views, and fixed a bug in DPV3085
	;  DPV3085 (12/13/2007) - Pass in stored ID to %Text search methods instead of fully formed Oid for stream fields
	;  BJB370  (11/30/2007) - Correrct typeo in noOtherReferences+10, $$$mtGroupDistinctList(m) should be $$$mtGroupDistinctList(qb)
	;  PVA150  (11/01/2007) - Fix query INSERT case broken by PVA139
	;  JLF185  (10/24/2007) - Performance improvement for %CONTAINS
	;  PVA139  (09/21/2007) - Allow updatable view to be streamed
	;  JLF180  (09/06/2007) - Check for FROM clause correlations in subquery transformations
	;  JLF171  (07/30/2007) - Enable subquery to view transform for correlated aggregate expressions
	;  PVA145  (06/19/2007) - <UNDEFINED>transformExists+23^%qaqpre *$$$mtR("+") error
