	;  PVA113  (11/20/2006) - Routine to perform full outer join
	;  PVA109  (11/24/2006) - query creation utility for FULL outer join
	;  PVA108  (11/22/2006) - Support RIGHT and LEFT joins with nested ON clauses and general predicates
	;  JLF131  (11/20/2006) - Organize mt("ON",m,*) into tree and migrate top-level inner joins to WHERE clause
	;  JLF125  (11/20/2006) - Use original stream properties for cloned stream
	;  PVA107  (11/15/2006) - a <SUBSCRIPT>pushlog+19^%qaqpnl *viewFvals("") error
	;  PVA106  (11/15/2006) - Fix problem created by JLF125
	;  JLF125  (11/08/2006) - Make dup view share all ifns with original view
	;  JLF126  (11/03/2006) - Remove extra <literal> IS [ NOT ] NULL logic (missing parentheses)
	;  JLF128  (11/03/2006) - Topologically order query blocks
	;  JLF127  (10/31/2006) - Fix [NOT] FOR ALL [%ELEMENT] [NOT] and NOT %CONTAINS
	;  JLF125  (10/18/2006) - Views on left of left outer join
	;  JLF122  (10/05/2006) - Suppress DISTINCT opt on UNION legs in non-ANSI GROUP BY case
	;  JLF119  (09/27/2006) - Fix $c(0) special case (including literal strings that start with $c(0) but contain additional characters)
	;  PVA099  (09/14/2006) - Extend PVA087 to views on the right hand side of a left join
	;  PVA102  (10/31/2006) - error in certian outer joins: <UNDEFINED>%C0o+3^CacheSql1 *%qscd(1,17)
	;  JLF125  (09/10/2006) - Support stream on left of left outer join
	;  JLF122  (09/05/2006) - Suppress distinct opt on UNION legs when outputs are not functionally determined by distincting exprs.
	;  PVA097  (09/07/2006) - Fix fld=fld optimization in JLF119
	;  JLF119  (09/06/2006) - Streamless expression optimization, plus fldX = fldX and fldX <> fldX optimization
	;  JLF117  (08/03/2006) - Enhance pushlog to support outer joins
	;  PVA094  (08/01/2006) - Push other joins into streamed view created for general outer joins.
	;  JLF020  (07/24/2006) - Fix needsCartesianProduct to handle outer joins
	;  JLF016  (07/24/2006) - make RowLevelSecurity consistent with Dan P's recent changes
	;  DPV2697 (07/12/2006) - Use $e(...,*) and $e(...,...,*) in SQL code
	;  PVA092  (06/24/2006) - Modify outer join data structure to avoid subscript size limit; assorted other outer join bugs.
	;  JLF113  (07/05/2006) - Add support for mt("ON",m) clause
	;  JLF091  (02/24/2006) - Invoke LANGUAGECLASS method rather than %Text.Text method
	;  DPV2595 (02/22/2006) - SQL Fix: New some variables
	;  DPV2587 (02/16/2006) - SQL Enhancement: Move ^CacheTempSMD($J) to ^||smd()
	;  JLF080  (02/14/2006) - Do HAVING clause analysis after flds/lflds
	;  JLF067  (10/05/2005) - Escape special chars in XML functions
